cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Loa22 druggability assessment — analysis code and data"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DonmigJC/loa22-druggability"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and data supporting a computational assessment of the
  druggability of the Leptospira interrogans Loa22 peptidoglycan-binding site.
  Includes cavity detection, generative molecular design with an
  untrained-prior control, dual-site docking of the resulting libraries,
  molecular dynamics simulations, and end-state free energy calculations.
